OL,3,AFormer Hamas bodyguard guilty of UK
OL,4,Aknife attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Hamas bodyguard, wanted in
OL,7,FGermany over an alleged plot to murder
OL,8,FJewish people, has been found guilty of
OL,9,Fa knife attack on a bailiff outside his
OL,10,FUK home.
OL,12,FMohammed Alfatih, also known as
OL,13,FMohammed Naim, had been photographed
OL,14,Fworking for the former leader of Hamas
OL,15,Fbefore being granted asylum in the UK
OL,16,Fin 2015 and British citizenship in
OL,17,F2020.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
